---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Lake View Park Play Areas for Children"
  description="Lake View Park children’s play areas in Islamabad: what CDA describes, age suitability, separate charges and practical tips for families."
  path="/kids-play-areas/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'What play equipment is there for children?', a: 'Families typically use the open lawns, lakeside paths and designated play areas. Specific rides and equipment are run by on-site operators and can change, so ask what is operating on the day.' },
    { q: 'Is there a separate charge for the play areas?', a: 'Children’s rides and play equipment are typically charged separately from any park access, by their operators. Confirm the current rate at the counter.' },
    { q: 'Is the park safe for toddlers?', a: 'The open lawns and paths are stroller-friendly, but keep toddlers supervised near the lake at all times, and check on site whether a fenced toddlers-only zone is available.' },
    { q: 'Are there toilets near the play areas?', a: 'Toilets are provided in the park but their exact open locations can change — ask management for the nearest open block.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Kids play areas', href: '/kids-play-areas/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad-view.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Family guide', href: '/family-guide/' },
    { label: 'Rides & attractions', href: '/rides-and-attractions/' },
    { label: 'Visitor facilities', href: '/visitor-facilities/' },
    { label: 'Picnic guide', href: '/picnic-guide/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Lake View Park is a popular family destination, and CDA’s destination description mentions children’s activities. This page sets expectations and flags what to confirm, without inventing a fixed ride list.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">What is there</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Families typically use the open lawns, lakeside paths and designated play areas. Specific rides and equipment are run by on-site operators and can change, so ask what is operating on the day.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Age suitability and charges</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Age ranges and any charges are set by each operator, so confirm at the counter before your child queues. Keep a plan B (the lawns and lake walk) in case a ride is closed.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Practical tips</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-8">
        <li>Keep the route short, shaded and close to restrooms for younger children.</li>
        <li>Bring water, sun protection and a change of clothes in case of splashes.</li>
        <li>Half a day is comfortable when you include food and rest breaks.</li>
        <li>Supervise children near the water at all times.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f3ede0] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#5b4a2f]">Confirm before you rely on it</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5b4a2f]">Play equipment can be closed for maintenance or weather. A flexible plan built around open space works even if a specific ride isn’t running.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Tips for a smooth family visit</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Shade is limited at midday and on-site food or supply availability is not guaranteed, so bring water, sun protection and a mat, and keep children supervised near the lake at all times. Confirm which play equipment is running and whether there is a separate charge before your child queues.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist items={[
      'Confirm which play equipment is operating on arrival.',
      'Bring water, sun protection and a mat — shade is limited at midday.',
      'Keep children supervised near the lake at all times.',
      'Ask about separate charges for rides or play equipment.',
      'Check the toilets with management and plan around naps and heat.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad-view.jpg" width="1440" height="960" alt="Lakeside structure at Rawal Lake near Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={3} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
